---
// The Index, at /index, where the wiki's channel-index links now point. It
// renders the Catalog snapshot the site pulls from the bot (ADR-0001); until
// the site has accepted one, it says the Index is unavailable rather than
// showing an empty Catalog. Member-gated; must stay server-rendered.
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Index" members>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Index</h1>
    <p>The Index is not available yet. In Discord, Papa Sherpa's <code>/find</code> points you to the Channels, Forums and Posts that match what you are into.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
